OL,3,GNEWSAFootball club postpones game after
OL,4,Acable theft
OL,5,
OL,6,FA football club is without power and
OL,7,Fhas had to cancel a match after the
OL,8,Ftheft of cables on its grounds.
OL,10,FThe break-in at Fawley AFC at the
OL,11,FWaterside Sports and Social Club in
OL,12,FHolbury, Southampton, has left the
OL,13,Fwhole site without power, and is also
OL,14,Faffecting its cricket, bowls and tennis
OL,15,Fsections.
OL,17,FIt means the Velocity Wessex League
OL,18,FDivision One match against Cove on
OL,19,FSaturday has been postponed.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
