OL,3,GNEWSAFootball club postpones game after
OL,4,Acable theft
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We are extremely disappointed that
OL,7,Findividuals have felt it acceptable to
OL,8,Fillegally enter our ground, steal
OL,9,Fessential equipment and cause
OL,10,Fsignificant damage," the club said on
OL,11,FFriday.
